{"id":"n67026-3-7","stage":1,"title":"어서 · 赶快","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67026-3-7-1","ko":"이러다가 학교에 늦겠어.","zh":"再这样下去要迟到了哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이러다가","meaning":"这么着","explanation":"이러다：这么着；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"이러다","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24838","senseId":"1","lemma":"이러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이러다가","audio":"/audio/3be51e901fa660ceb1df.mp3"}},{"text":"학교에","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교에","audio":"/audio/73b845af583b8fb74d39.mp3"}},{"text":"늦겠어.","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦겠어","audio":"/audio/551299df9b6fb09f184c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a42eace37d0e6c18","term":"이러다","zh":"这么着","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3","entryId":"24838","definition":"这样做。","pronunciation":["이러다"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e912ae87adbfac4d2268.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67026-3-7-2","ko":"어서 출발하자.","zh":"我们赶紧出发吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어서","meaning":"赶快","explanation":"어서：赶快。","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"3","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}},{"text":"출발하자.","meaning":"出发","explanation":"출발하다：出发；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"출발하다","audio":"/audio/9d29571af3ae5f65bacf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72141","senseId":"1","lemma":"출발하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출발하자","audio":"/audio/e17eac5b965079a59d62.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"赶快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"不拖延而快地。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"9d29571af3ae5f65","term":"출발하다","zh":"出发","audio":"/audio/9d29571af3ae5f65bacf.mp3","entryId":"72141","definition":"离开原地向某处去。","pronunciation":["출발하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0850d8a60a946fed32b7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.88,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67026","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.203,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["再这样下去要迟到了哦。","我们赶紧出发吧。","敏俊啊，我总是很担心你有没有吃饭，有没有顺利去上学。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["再这样下去要迟到了哦。","我们赶紧出发吧。","敏俊啊，我总是很担心你有没有吃饭，有没有顺利去上学。"],"answer":1}]}
